# 9. TTS Provider Abstraction

This is one of the most important architectural requirements.

Create a provider interface.

Conceptually:

```python
class TTSProvider:
    def synthesize(self, request) -> TTSResult:
        raise NotImplementedError

    def get_voices(self):
        raise NotImplementedError

    def health_check(self):
        raise NotImplementedError
```

`TTSRequest` should include:

```text
text
voice_id
language
locale
model
speed
pitch
style
stability
similarity
format
sample_rate
```

`TTSResult` should include:

```text
audio
provider_request_id
duration
format
metadata
```

Implement provider adapters independently.

Example:

```text
ProviderAdapterA
ProviderAdapterB
SelfHostedProvider
```

Business logic must call:

```text
TTS Router
```

not a vendor SDK directly.

