# 26. Credit Reservation

Avoid race conditions.

Example:

```text
Request generation
↓
calculate cost
↓
atomic reservation
↓
enqueue
```

If generation fails:

```text
release/refund reservation
```

If generation completes:

```text
convert reservation → final usage
```

Use database transactions and idempotency keys.

