# 87. Retry Strategy

Retry only:

- provider timeout
- network failure
- temporary provider 5xx
- transient storage failure

Do not retry:

- invalid text
- invalid voice
- quota exceeded
- unauthorized cloning
- malformed request

Use exponential backoff and maximum retry count.

